WEBVTT

00:00:01.510 --> 00:00:03.030
Hey! Over here!

00:00:11.420 --> 00:00:13.010
Um, President.

00:00:13.010 --> 00:00:13.990
What did you just say?

00:00:14.540 --> 00:00:16.490
I said, in light of the school's demands,

00:00:16.950 --> 00:00:21.000
all occult club activities
 will be suspended as of today.

00:00:23.160 --> 00:00:28.130
Episode 7
"A Place Lost"

00:00:24.050 --> 00:00:27.160
Wh-What do you mean,
our activities will be suspended?!

00:00:29.010 --> 00:00:32.260
Does Inoue's disappearance have
something to do with this?

00:00:32.610 --> 00:00:34.260
That is absolutely correct.

00:00:36.360 --> 00:00:40.260
<i>It's been five days since Inoue called me,
and then disappeared into the forest.</i>

00:00:40.970 --> 00:00:42.220
Inoue-san...

00:00:42.730 --> 00:00:44.170
She was a good person.

00:00:44.170 --> 00:00:46.020
Shizuru, you knew her?

00:00:46.020 --> 00:00:47.510
She gave me sweets.

00:00:47.510 --> 00:00:48.690
I see.

00:00:48.690 --> 00:00:50.860
We talked about you lots.

00:00:51.280 --> 00:00:55.280
I told her all I knew about your tendencies,
leaving nothing out.

00:00:55.280 --> 00:00:57.690
You don't mean "tendencies" 
in a dirty way, right?!

00:00:58.330 --> 00:01:00.390
<i>You</i> were her informant?

00:01:00.390 --> 00:01:04.620
So, they're saying it'd be inappropriate
to hold club activities right now?

00:01:04.820 --> 00:01:07.340
You're way off. That's not the point.

00:01:07.340 --> 00:01:11.250
But, yeah, this is no time to be having fun
without a care in the world.

00:01:11.550 --> 00:01:14.790
I'm not happy about it,
but we've got to be understanding.

00:01:14.790 --> 00:01:15.550
Other clubs will also have to deal—

00:01:15.550 --> 00:01:18.120
Only the occult club is ceasing activities.

00:01:18.120 --> 00:01:18.940
What?

00:01:18.940 --> 00:01:21.390
Why are they singling out the occult club?

00:01:21.800 --> 00:01:23.720
One, that Inoue girl

00:01:23.720 --> 00:01:28.200
made her rivalry with you known far and wide.

00:01:28.200 --> 00:01:33.740
And two, you were also
the last person she spoke with.

00:01:33.740 --> 00:01:35.590
That about covers the reasons why.

00:01:35.590 --> 00:01:37.910
Why are they making Kotarou-kun
out to be the bad guy?

00:01:38.280 --> 00:01:42.840
Of course, Inoue's lapse in judgment
is the cause of this entire mess,

00:01:42.840 --> 00:01:44.830
but now that she is missing,

00:01:44.830 --> 00:01:47.920
the only ones they can pin 
the blame onto are Tennouji

00:01:48.080 --> 00:01:50.420
and the dubious group 
known as the occult club.

00:01:51.300 --> 00:01:55.100
Next, they'll go from suspending activities
to disbanding our club completely,

00:01:55.100 --> 00:01:57.370
and appease the parents and media that way.

00:01:57.740 --> 00:01:59.430
I'm sure that's what the school has in mind.

00:01:59.660 --> 00:02:01.420
Disbanding the occult club?

00:02:01.420 --> 00:02:03.560
What will you do about it, President?

00:02:04.180 --> 00:02:06.310
I think the club's disbanding is unavoidable.

00:02:07.350 --> 00:02:09.120
If we try to keep it going no matter what,

00:02:09.120 --> 00:02:12.360
they might switch targets to
individual members.

00:02:12.550 --> 00:02:15.570
We haven't done anything wrong!
Why do we have to blindly do as they say?!

00:02:15.570 --> 00:02:19.280
Not one person here could possibly
accept something so stupid—

00:02:21.520 --> 00:02:24.030
It means playtime is over.

00:02:24.310 --> 00:02:25.430
Wait.

00:02:25.430 --> 00:02:27.290
Isn't this our rightful place?

00:02:27.530 --> 00:02:31.090
We were only getting started, 
but we had a good thing going!

00:02:31.090 --> 00:02:32.920
Isn't this where we all belong?

00:02:33.330 --> 00:02:36.730
We got together, hung out,
did stupid stuff...

00:02:37.890 --> 00:02:39.260
We're comrades!

00:02:39.260 --> 00:02:40.540
We're amigos!

00:02:40.540 --> 00:02:41.780
We bonded!

00:02:41.780 --> 00:02:42.800
We're friends!

00:02:42.800 --> 00:02:44.840
Don't all of you feel the same way?!

00:02:47.630 --> 00:02:51.350
We're all completely different people,
but we worked well together.

00:02:51.350 --> 00:02:53.110
We had fun being together, right?

00:02:53.440 --> 00:02:56.320
Are you really okay with having those fun
times taken from us for no good reason?

00:02:57.310 --> 00:03:00.440
I know a time will come where we all
have to go our separate ways.

00:03:00.970 --> 00:03:03.320
But that's exactly why

00:03:03.760 --> 00:03:06.040
I want to spend my short school life

00:03:07.120 --> 00:03:07.950
right here.

00:03:10.870 --> 00:03:14.640
I want to enjoy my youth with all of you!
Is that so wrong?!

00:03:21.780 --> 00:03:23.900
Talk about a passionate speech.

00:03:23.900 --> 00:03:25.640
That was pretty fiery, Kotarou.

00:03:26.720 --> 00:03:30.430
I'm sure everyone feels the same way.

00:03:30.430 --> 00:03:31.380
Chihaya...

00:03:31.380 --> 00:03:33.400
But we've got a bull's-eye on our back now.

00:03:33.730 --> 00:03:37.610
My influence won't do us 
any good in this situation.

00:03:38.300 --> 00:03:40.240
But, put another way,

00:03:40.240 --> 00:03:43.030
it can be turned around
as long as Inoue is found, right?

00:03:43.590 --> 00:03:46.230
This hasn't been made public yet,

00:03:46.230 --> 00:03:48.660
but the search for her has been called off.

00:03:49.020 --> 00:03:50.040
Which means...

00:03:50.300 --> 00:03:54.630
They haven't found her body yet,
but they seem to have concluded she's dead.

00:03:54.780 --> 00:03:57.760
We just have to find Inoue ourselves, then!

00:03:57.760 --> 00:04:01.560
If they haven't found a body, 
then she could still be alive!

00:04:01.560 --> 00:04:03.990
The adults weren't able to find her.

00:04:03.990 --> 00:04:05.390
Do you really think we'll be able to?

00:04:05.650 --> 00:04:06.730
I don't know,

00:04:07.140 --> 00:04:09.930
but as long as there's even a small chance,

00:04:09.930 --> 00:04:11.390
I want to give it a shot!

00:04:11.770 --> 00:04:12.860
You're right.

00:04:13.190 --> 00:04:16.010
Knowing you, you might 
be able to pull it off.

00:04:16.350 --> 00:04:18.770
If you're going to do it, then so am I.

00:04:18.770 --> 00:04:21.070
Yes! I'm fine with it!

00:04:21.070 --> 00:04:21.630
Yeah.

00:04:21.630 --> 00:04:23.030
I'll help out, too.

00:04:23.300 --> 00:04:24.480
Sheesh...

00:04:24.480 --> 00:04:27.030
What was I thinking,
taking such troublesome people in?

00:04:28.320 --> 00:04:29.440
You guys!

00:04:32.580 --> 00:04:35.080
All right, is everyone ready?

00:04:35.350 --> 00:04:37.230
I made lunches for everyone.

00:04:37.230 --> 00:04:38.080
Thanks for that.

00:04:38.080 --> 00:04:41.660
I brought a change of clothes and 
other things for when we find Inoue.

00:04:41.660 --> 00:04:43.140
I've got the medical supplies covered.

00:04:43.140 --> 00:04:43.970
You're life savers.

00:04:43.970 --> 00:04:44.750
I—

00:04:44.750 --> 00:04:45.830
Thanks for the snacks.

00:04:45.830 --> 00:04:47.520
How did you know?!

00:04:47.520 --> 00:04:49.100
Um, and the president...

00:04:50.400 --> 00:04:52.430
Well, it's great that she came at all.

00:04:52.890 --> 00:04:55.150
It'd be dumb if a search party ended up
needing its own search party,

00:04:55.150 --> 00:04:57.400
so we'll look for her until 3PM,
and then pull out.

00:04:57.730 --> 00:04:58.570
Okay, then!

00:04:58.570 --> 00:05:01.320
Inoue Search Quest begins right now!

00:05:10.140 --> 00:05:12.200
This should work for our search route.

00:05:13.700 --> 00:05:15.200
If that's what she was after,

00:05:15.200 --> 00:05:17.900
then we should be able to
retrace her path to some extent.

00:05:17.900 --> 00:05:19.170
Just you wait, Inoue!

00:05:19.170 --> 00:05:21.210
Oh, if it isn't Slowtarou-kun.

00:05:21.830 --> 00:05:23.210
Sakuya...

00:05:23.440 --> 00:05:25.790
To think we'd run into
each other like this again...

00:05:25.790 --> 00:05:27.490
This truly must be fate,

00:05:27.860 --> 00:05:29.640
Pissant Peontarou-kun.

00:05:30.070 --> 00:05:34.140
That doesn't sound very cool when you say it
with convenience store bags in hand.

00:05:34.140 --> 00:05:36.400
These are Chihaya-san's snacks for tomorrow.

00:05:36.400 --> 00:05:38.400
What does she think this is, a picnic?

00:05:40.370 --> 00:05:42.520
As someone with more life experience,
let me give you a warning.

00:05:43.630 --> 00:05:46.190
If you treasure your current, ordinary life,

00:05:46.190 --> 00:05:48.740
then stop sticking your nose
where it doesn't belong.

00:05:48.740 --> 00:05:50.410
What's that supposed to mean?

00:05:51.450 --> 00:05:53.540
Exactly what it sounds like.

00:05:54.390 --> 00:05:55.760
Hey, hold on!

00:06:00.130 --> 00:06:01.920
<i>He's just running his mouth like usual.</i>

00:06:02.220 --> 00:06:04.670
Kotarou, these look like Inoue-san's tracks.

00:06:04.880 --> 00:06:05.900
What did you say?

00:06:07.990 --> 00:06:10.500
It looks like an ordinary depression to me.

00:06:10.500 --> 00:06:12.550
No, this is definitely a shoe print.

00:06:12.840 --> 00:06:15.110
It's fairly old, so it's starting to fade.

00:06:15.110 --> 00:06:17.560
<i>That's an agent of a secret 
organization for you!</i>

00:06:17.560 --> 00:06:18.560
Can you follow it, Shizuru?

00:06:19.120 --> 00:06:19.940
I'll try.

00:06:30.200 --> 00:06:31.590
The trail disappeared.

00:06:31.590 --> 00:06:35.160
It's like she wrapped her shoes in leaves 
or something and concealed her footprints.

00:06:35.400 --> 00:06:37.260
Was she worried about pursuers?

00:06:37.260 --> 00:06:39.160
Why would she go to all that trouble?

00:06:39.330 --> 00:06:41.790
Oh, when you're doing something secret,

00:06:41.790 --> 00:06:45.120
you get wary of pursuers and conspiracies,
and start doing stuff like that.

00:06:45.120 --> 00:06:46.020
She must be sick.

00:06:46.020 --> 00:06:48.420
Yeah, with a terrible disease
exclusive to youth.

00:06:48.420 --> 00:06:51.180
You understand how it works,
so don't act like you don't have it, too.

00:06:51.640 --> 00:06:53.430
Anyway, excuse me a moment.

00:06:53.430 --> 00:06:54.850
Oh, I need to use the bathroom, too.

00:06:54.850 --> 00:06:55.640
I'll join you.

00:06:55.640 --> 00:06:56.560
Me, too.

00:06:58.450 --> 00:07:01.310
Why do girls always go to 
the bathroom in groups?

00:07:04.550 --> 00:07:07.940
<i>What intel about this forest 
did Inoue get her hands on?</i>

00:07:08.610 --> 00:07:12.700
<i>Is this place really the scene of
the sort of conspiracy she'd be into?</i>

00:07:13.250 --> 00:07:14.700
<i>If so, then what could it be?</i>

00:07:18.470 --> 00:07:20.400
They sure are taking their time.

00:07:20.400 --> 00:07:21.830
Wait, it's been thirty minutes?!

00:07:21.830 --> 00:07:22.500
Damn!

00:07:22.500 --> 00:07:23.830
I totally zoned out!

00:07:25.990 --> 00:07:27.590
I can't get through on the phone, either!

00:07:27.820 --> 00:07:29.480
What the heck's going on?

00:07:29.480 --> 00:07:31.670
Damn! The sun is going to set soon!

00:07:33.210 --> 00:07:34.600
Where did you guys go—

00:07:44.860 --> 00:07:46.730
<i>What's with that guy?</i>

00:07:48.650 --> 00:07:51.400
<i>I'm not sure what his deal is,
but he seems dangerous!</i>

00:07:51.620 --> 00:07:53.100
<i>Where is everyone?!</i>

00:07:57.460 --> 00:07:58.950
<i>The dog from before?</i>

00:07:59.280 --> 00:08:01.620
<i>No, it looks similar, but it's different!</i>

00:08:03.530 --> 00:08:04.520
<i>Not good.</i>

00:08:04.920 --> 00:08:06.340
<i>Not good, not good!</i>

00:08:06.900 --> 00:08:08.130
<i>These things</i>

00:08:09.220 --> 00:08:11.260
<i>want to kill me!</i>

00:08:18.020 --> 00:08:18.850
<i>It's fast!</i>

00:08:18.850 --> 00:08:20.850
<i>Damn, the enhancement from 
the other day isn't enough!</i>

00:08:21.600 --> 00:08:22.220
<i>In that case...</i>

00:08:23.440 --> 00:08:25.020
<i>I'll kick it up a notch 
and rewrite myself again!</i>

00:08:38.910 --> 00:08:40.200
<i>Rewrite complete!</i>

00:08:40.520 --> 00:08:43.710
<i>Crap, my body still isn't 
used to the enhancement!</i>

00:08:49.400 --> 00:08:50.380
No way!

00:08:57.220 --> 00:08:58.420
You frickin' dog!

00:09:02.680 --> 00:09:05.890
<i>If I circulate power through my whole body...</i>

00:09:05.890 --> 00:09:09.270
Damn you!

00:09:16.530 --> 00:09:17.940
What the hell just happened?

00:09:22.180 --> 00:09:24.350
What is this?!

00:09:28.220 --> 00:09:29.730
It vanished?

00:09:30.350 --> 00:09:31.830
I defeated it with this thing?

00:09:35.740 --> 00:09:37.630
Seriously, what the hell is this?

00:09:38.000 --> 00:09:40.940
Did I hit the accelerator
 too hard or something?

00:09:43.720 --> 00:09:44.920
<i>I would've died.</i>

00:09:44.920 --> 00:09:48.450
<i>If not for those strange blades,
I would have died.</i>

00:09:48.880 --> 00:09:49.720
<i>Wait.</i>

00:09:49.720 --> 00:09:53.040
<i>Inoue... No, Kotori and the 
others are in this forest, too!</i>

00:09:53.040 --> 00:09:53.530
Shizuru!

00:09:54.740 --> 00:09:56.150
Is that Lucia's voice?!

00:10:12.550 --> 00:10:14.100
What are those?

00:10:16.240 --> 00:10:17.590
Lucia! Shizuru!

00:10:22.620 --> 00:10:23.720
This is bad!

00:11:12.240 --> 00:11:13.540
What's going on?

00:11:13.870 --> 00:11:15.320
Am I dreaming?

00:11:17.270 --> 00:11:18.820
Lucia! Shizuru!

00:11:19.140 --> 00:11:19.990
Kotarou!

00:11:20.470 --> 00:11:22.360
What in the world is going on?

00:11:22.360 --> 00:11:24.900
And what are you swinging around?

00:11:28.220 --> 00:11:29.330
Shizuru!

00:11:32.720 --> 00:11:33.920
What a terrible wound...

00:11:34.200 --> 00:11:35.090
I'll heal you right now.

00:11:35.090 --> 00:11:36.920
Stay still, Kotarou.

00:11:39.050 --> 00:11:41.170
What are those monsters?

00:11:41.340 --> 00:11:43.320
Guardian's enemies. Our enemies.

00:11:43.320 --> 00:11:45.200
Monsters controlled by Gaia.

00:11:45.200 --> 00:11:48.970
Even if those <i>are</i> from Gaia, 
what are they doing here?

00:11:48.970 --> 00:11:50.050
I don't know.

00:11:50.050 --> 00:11:52.240
They could have set up 
their base in this forest,

00:11:53.070 --> 00:11:56.110
or... they could be searching for the Key.

00:11:56.610 --> 00:11:57.520
The Key...

00:11:58.310 --> 00:12:02.840
Right now, Kazamatsuri City 
is in a volatile situation

00:12:02.840 --> 00:12:06.990
due to an individual who holds the key
to Earth's survival or its destruction.

00:12:08.310 --> 00:12:10.500
Kotarou, you should be okay now.

00:12:12.750 --> 00:12:14.910
Taking another look at it, 
that really is amazing!

00:12:14.910 --> 00:12:15.780
Thanks!

00:12:15.780 --> 00:12:18.440
Go look for Kotori and the others, quickly.

00:12:18.710 --> 00:12:20.340
That's right! Where are the others?

00:12:20.530 --> 00:12:21.390
Sorry.

00:12:21.390 --> 00:12:24.090
We got separated from them 
after we sensed the monsters.

00:12:24.300 --> 00:12:24.930
What?

00:12:24.930 --> 00:12:28.080
So they could be under attack 
by those monsters, too?

00:12:28.080 --> 00:12:28.760
Damn it!

00:12:28.760 --> 00:12:30.420
We'll hold down the fort here.

00:12:30.420 --> 00:12:32.360
Take care of Kotori and the 
others for us, Kotarou.

00:12:32.360 --> 00:12:33.640
Uh, but...

00:12:33.640 --> 00:12:37.760
We've undergone combat training 
in order to fight these monsters.

00:12:37.760 --> 00:12:39.900
These numbers won't pose a problem.

00:12:40.850 --> 00:12:42.820
Don't overdo it, you two!

00:12:51.790 --> 00:12:53.040
Go, Kotarou!

00:12:53.240 --> 00:12:54.110
Thanks!

00:13:00.300 --> 00:13:01.960
Where are you, Kotori?!

00:13:02.800 --> 00:13:03.720
Chihaya!

00:13:03.720 --> 00:13:04.800
President!

00:13:05.880 --> 00:13:06.720
Take that!

00:13:07.690 --> 00:13:08.300
Oh?

00:13:08.300 --> 00:13:09.900
Is that you, Kotarou?

00:13:09.900 --> 00:13:10.920
I'm sorry.

00:13:10.920 --> 00:13:12.850
I thought you were a bear or something.

00:13:13.060 --> 00:13:15.350
Didn't I shout your name out loud?!

00:13:15.860 --> 00:13:16.350
Hey!

00:13:16.610 --> 00:13:18.920
Kotarou-kun, how did you get that injury?

00:13:18.920 --> 00:13:20.360
What happened?

00:13:20.360 --> 00:13:21.010
Huh?!

00:13:21.010 --> 00:13:22.610
Did I do that?

00:13:22.840 --> 00:13:24.220
Uh, no.

00:13:24.220 --> 00:13:25.750
I'm fine now.

00:13:25.750 --> 00:13:27.850
Anyway, hurry, you three!

00:13:27.850 --> 00:13:29.240
We've gotta get out of this forest!

00:13:29.390 --> 00:13:30.190
We're running away?

00:13:30.190 --> 00:13:31.880
But we haven't found the other two yet.

00:13:31.880 --> 00:13:32.780
I know!

00:13:32.780 --> 00:13:34.160
They're fine, so hurry!

00:13:34.160 --> 00:13:36.380
Jeez. Why are you in such a rush?

00:13:36.380 --> 00:13:37.870
It's seriously dangerous here!

00:13:38.140 --> 00:13:40.130
Anyway, for now, just trust me—

00:13:44.200 --> 00:13:46.220
What... is that?

00:13:56.650 --> 00:13:57.310
Huh?

00:14:03.710 --> 00:14:05.440
K-Kotarou...

00:14:05.960 --> 00:14:07.570
Kotarou-kun, your arm.

00:14:07.900 --> 00:14:09.350
Run away, all of you!

00:14:09.350 --> 00:14:13.330
Lucia and Shizuru are ahead! Meet up 
with them and get out of the forest!

00:14:20.540 --> 00:14:21.420
Hey, Tennouji?!

00:14:21.830 --> 00:14:24.050
It's stabbing through your arm...

00:14:24.050 --> 00:14:25.710
Forget me. Get out of here!

00:14:26.840 --> 00:14:28.600
A-Akane-san.

00:14:29.070 --> 00:14:29.840
I know.

00:14:30.050 --> 00:14:30.720
Right away.

00:14:31.180 --> 00:14:32.040
Just wait.

00:14:32.040 --> 00:14:34.680
We'll get help and come 
back for you right away!

00:14:56.000 --> 00:14:56.950
Damn it!

00:14:56.950 --> 00:14:57.790
Let go!

00:14:58.160 --> 00:15:00.680
Let me go!

00:15:02.480 --> 00:15:04.540
Damn it!

00:15:27.330 --> 00:15:28.940
This again?

00:15:38.540 --> 00:15:40.580
You son of a bitch!

00:15:50.100 --> 00:15:51.020
Shit!

00:15:53.320 --> 00:15:55.220
<i>Oh no. I might be a goner.</i>

00:16:05.120 --> 00:16:06.770
It's you...

00:16:22.000 --> 00:16:23.460
S-Stay away!

00:16:42.490 --> 00:16:43.620
Don't!

00:16:44.250 --> 00:16:46.440
Let me go! She's... She's...

00:16:46.440 --> 00:16:47.730
You can't!

00:16:47.730 --> 00:16:49.230
Go away!

00:17:05.540 --> 00:17:06.580
Kotori.

00:17:06.580 --> 00:17:08.000
You can see her?

00:17:08.950 --> 00:17:11.970
Let's go home with everyone else. Okay?

00:17:17.080 --> 00:17:19.760
I'm sure we'll find Inoue-san.

00:17:20.020 --> 00:17:22.520
Once we do, let's hold
occult club activities again.

00:17:23.440 --> 00:17:25.270
Yeah, let's.

00:17:25.920 --> 00:17:28.400
Are Shizu-chan and the class rep this way?

00:17:29.410 --> 00:17:30.610
<i>You're okay, right?</i>

00:17:30.610 --> 00:17:32.280
<i>Please be safe, you two...</i>

00:17:39.300 --> 00:17:41.160
They defeated them all?

00:17:41.460 --> 00:17:42.540
Kotarou?

00:17:42.910 --> 00:17:44.380
I'm glad you're safe.

00:17:44.380 --> 00:17:45.540
You too, Kotori.

00:17:45.540 --> 00:17:47.160
Y-Yeah.

00:17:47.160 --> 00:17:48.220
We managed somehow.

00:17:50.480 --> 00:17:51.560
Thank goodness.

00:17:51.560 --> 00:17:53.010
You managed to meet up?

00:17:53.010 --> 00:17:54.330
Don't move, Kotarou.

00:17:54.330 --> 00:17:55.300
Lucia?

00:17:58.070 --> 00:18:00.930
<i>Why is everyone so tense?</i>

00:18:01.220 --> 00:18:03.580
Would you answer a few 
questions for me, President?

00:18:03.580 --> 00:18:04.680
What would those be?

00:18:05.050 --> 00:18:07.140
When we met up,

00:18:07.640 --> 00:18:09.580
there were still monsters around.

00:18:10.540 --> 00:18:11.560
And then...

00:18:16.420 --> 00:18:19.200
You were both completely defenseless,

00:18:19.480 --> 00:18:21.440
so why didn't those monsters 
go after you at all?

00:18:21.700 --> 00:18:23.400
W-Well...

00:18:23.400 --> 00:18:25.700
Maybe they were just picky?

00:18:26.020 --> 00:18:27.220
One more question.

00:18:27.220 --> 00:18:30.580
Why weren't either of you 
surprised when you saw them?

00:18:30.900 --> 00:18:34.380
It may have looked that way
because we were frozen in fear.

00:18:34.380 --> 00:18:35.130
That's a lie.

00:18:35.130 --> 00:18:37.550
Your heartbeat, facial muscles, breathing...

00:18:37.550 --> 00:18:39.780
All of them were perfectly normal.

00:18:39.780 --> 00:18:41.600
It's true that I was surprised.

00:18:41.600 --> 00:18:44.220
After all, I never could have imagined this.

00:18:44.500 --> 00:18:47.120
Who would have thought you were hunters...

00:18:47.120 --> 00:18:49.480
Guardian superhumans?

00:18:49.720 --> 00:18:50.420
Huh?

00:18:50.720 --> 00:18:52.800
President, what did you just say?

00:18:52.800 --> 00:18:53.510
Kotarou.

00:18:53.510 --> 00:18:55.480
Those two are our enemies.

00:18:55.650 --> 00:18:56.460
Enemies?

00:18:56.460 --> 00:18:58.350
By enemies, you can't mean...

00:18:58.350 --> 00:18:59.740
G-Gaia?

00:19:00.440 --> 00:19:02.110
Kotarou, are you with them?

00:19:02.110 --> 00:19:03.440
Kotarou isn't like that.

00:19:03.440 --> 00:19:05.080
He isn't?

00:19:05.420 --> 00:19:07.330
Well, not that it matters.

00:19:07.330 --> 00:19:09.710
It won't change anything either way.

00:19:10.080 --> 00:19:11.860
I suppose not.

00:19:14.210 --> 00:19:16.810
Huh? W-Wait a second.

00:19:16.810 --> 00:19:19.090
Why does it feel like you're about to fight?

00:19:19.280 --> 00:19:20.400
I believe I told you...

00:19:20.400 --> 00:19:22.970
Playtime is over.

00:19:22.970 --> 00:19:24.470
Stand back, Kotarou.

00:19:24.780 --> 00:19:25.790
What's going on?

00:19:26.310 --> 00:19:27.720
What is all this?

00:19:28.260 --> 00:19:29.140
Chi.

00:19:29.140 --> 00:19:30.480
What is it?

00:19:30.760 --> 00:19:33.980
Were you two the ones who attacked us?

00:19:34.540 --> 00:19:36.860
What if I said we were?

00:19:37.800 --> 00:19:38.900
You wench!

00:19:38.900 --> 00:19:40.070
Lucia, stop!

00:19:44.810 --> 00:19:47.010
A high-frequency blade?

00:19:47.730 --> 00:19:49.830
That is a little bit numbing.

00:19:51.090 --> 00:19:52.840
Sakuya?

00:19:53.420 --> 00:19:56.000
You're one of them too, Ohtori Sakuya?

00:19:56.300 --> 00:19:56.950
Yes.

00:19:57.240 --> 00:20:00.930
I am a member of Gaia, 
and I serve Chihaya-san.

00:20:01.330 --> 00:20:05.840
Also, I will say this for the honor 
of Chihaya-san and Lady Akane.

00:20:06.270 --> 00:20:09.440
Neither of them had anything 
to do with this incident.

00:20:09.990 --> 00:20:14.020
This just happened to coincide with an 
unfortunate accident within the organization.

00:20:14.300 --> 00:20:15.740
You expect us to believe that?

00:20:15.740 --> 00:20:18.380
That is at your and Shizuru-san's discretion.

00:20:18.380 --> 00:20:19.600
That's how it was?

00:20:20.270 --> 00:20:21.360
Shizuru...

00:20:21.360 --> 00:20:23.030
You're saying too much, Sakuya.

00:20:23.480 --> 00:20:24.460
Let's go.

00:20:24.460 --> 00:20:26.200
We have no further business here.

00:20:26.200 --> 00:20:27.330
Understood.

00:20:28.380 --> 00:20:30.190
Please do excuse us.

00:20:39.520 --> 00:20:42.590
I thought I finally made some friends...

00:20:44.090 --> 00:20:45.590
W-Wait!

00:20:48.100 --> 00:20:48.850
Huh?

00:20:50.960 --> 00:20:53.100
W... Wait...

00:20:55.010 --> 00:20:56.770
Hang in there, Kotarou.

00:20:56.770 --> 00:20:58.270
His body gave out?

00:20:58.660 --> 00:20:59.730
That's not surprising.

00:21:02.040 --> 00:21:03.410
I see.

00:21:04.040 --> 00:21:06.260
It's all going to end...

00:21:33.890 --> 00:21:35.360
Good morning.

00:21:35.360 --> 00:21:39.400
Your homeroom teacher, Nishikujou-sensei, 
had an emergency...

00:21:37.150 --> 00:21:39.400
Kotori

00:21:37.150 --> 00:21:39.400
Today

00:21:37.150 --> 00:21:39.400
Canceled

00:21:37.150 --> 00:21:39.400
Call me

00:21:37.150 --> 00:21:39.400
I'm waiting

00:21:37.150 --> 00:21:39.400
No answer

00:21:37.150 --> 00:21:39.400
Heeeey

00:21:37.150 --> 00:21:39.400
Where are you

00:21:45.570 --> 00:21:47.320
Kotori

00:21:45.570 --> 00:21:47.320
No answer

00:21:45.570 --> 00:21:47.320
Heeeey

00:21:45.570 --> 00:21:47.320
Where are you

00:21:45.570 --> 00:21:47.320
No answer

00:21:45.570 --> 00:21:47.320
I'm begging you, call me

00:21:45.570 --> 00:21:47.320
Canceled

00:21:48.270 --> 00:21:49.600
Hey, Tennouji.

00:21:50.500 --> 00:21:52.480
Sorry, I didn't notice.

00:21:52.480 --> 00:21:53.240
What is it?

00:21:53.550 --> 00:21:54.940
How should I put this...

00:21:54.940 --> 00:21:57.000
Are you in some sort of trouble?

00:21:57.220 --> 00:21:58.550
Oh, no.

00:21:58.940 --> 00:22:00.000
Everything's fine.

00:22:11.130 --> 00:22:13.670
If you treasure your current, ordinary life,

00:22:14.270 --> 00:22:17.230
then stop sticking your nose
where it doesn't belong.

00:22:18.720 --> 00:22:20.770
<i>Why did I forget?</i>

00:22:21.980 --> 00:22:24.960
<i>That an uneventful-yet-precious ordinary life</i>

00:22:25.390 --> 00:22:29.340
<i>can be crushed to pieces so easily...</i>
